<title>GERMANY: Osram 95/96 net profit rises to 262 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Osram 95/96 net profit rises to 262 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end of September</p>
<p>1996  (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit (after tax)	   262     vs 223</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     369     vs 366</p>
<p>    Group sales				  5,706   vs 5,444</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     Germany				     780     vs 786</p>
<p>     International			     4,926   vs 4,658</p>
<p>    Capital investment			 396     vs 366</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     Germany				     86	vs 100</p>
<p>     International			     310     vs 266</p>
<p>    No of employees			    26,158  vs 26,979</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     Germany				     7,785   vs 7,888</p>
<p>     International			     18,373  vs 19,091</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German lighting group is Osram GmbH. Osram is the lighting unit of Siemens AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
